  "system": {
    "description": "<section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block scrpg-archetype-block-intro\"><p>You command an arsenal of spells and mystical forces.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Powers/Qualities</div><p>Assign one or more of the dice you rolled at the end of the power source step to any of these powers:</p><p>• Select from Elemental/Energy powers category</p><p>• Select from Materials powers category</p><p>• Select from Mobility powers category</p><p>• Select from Psychic powers category</p><p>• Select from Self Control powers category</p><p>Assign any remaining dice to any of these qualities:</p><p>• Select from Information qualities category</p><p>• Select from Mental qualities category</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Abilities</div><p>Gain two of the following Green abilities, using two different powers.</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.imnA8a70pkaz0abA]{Banish}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.ebJxg6qUjmPnLeYe]{Energy Jaunt}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.HF3Da8MT2unKCQ99]{Powerful Blast}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.ccfZVifaC4QubTZk]{Subdue}</li></ul><p>Gain one of these Yellow abilities.</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.Qnvb3r0lB1inQSRo]{Cords of Magic}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.uqmhNqGBWd5UT21Y]{Field of Energy}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.SkJ0L648OB64L2F0]{Living Bomb}</li></ul></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Principle</div><p>Choose an Esoteric principle.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Personality</div><p>Roll d10, d10 for personality selection.</p></section>"
  },
